r was born in Proctor, Vermont on August 15, 1891.\", \"answer\": \"August 15, 1891\", \"quote\": \"Asa Schoonmaker \\\"Ace\\\" Bloomer was born in Proctor, Vermont on August 15, 1891.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0366-85f85cb2887c:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0366-85f85cb2887c:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"Senator Bloomer\", \"scope\": \"Birth date\", \"claim\": \"John Henry Bloomer was born in Rutland on September 14, 1930.\", \"answer\": \"September 14, 1930\", \"quote\": \"John Henry Bloomer was born in Rutland on September 14, 1930.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0366-85f85cb2887c:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0366-85f85cb2887c:d02:c0\", \"entity\": \"Senator Bloomer\", \"scope\": \"Birth date\", \"claim\": \"Robert Asa Bloomer was born in Proctor, Vermont on November 13, 1921.\", \"answer\": \"November 13, 1921\", \"quote\": \"Robert Asa Bloomer was born in Proctor, Vermont on November 13, 1921.\", \"original_document_number\": 3}]}"
